---
/** Atlas — ask it something about your own contracts and it answers from
    the Vault, with a citation. The composer is live: type a question. */
const REPLIES = [
  'Your Offbeat Mara contract lists full board at USD 410 per person per night through March, with a four-night minimum. Source: Offbeat contract 2026.pdf · p.2.',
  'Andes Trail’s Sacred Valley tariff is valid to December 2026: USD 385 per person for the two-day walking programme, transfers included. Source: Andes Trail — Sacred Valley tariff.xlsx.',
  'Nothing in your Vault covers that yet. Upload the contract and I’ll read it — I don’t answer from outside data.',
];
---
<div class="mk-panel wide" data-thread>
  <div class="mk-msg me"><p>What did we agree with Rift Valley for Mara North game drives this March — and is the park fee included?</p></div>
  <svg class="mk-spark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2c.6 5.4 4.6 9.4 10 10-5.4.6-9.4 4.6-10 10-.6-5.4-4.6-9.4-10-10 5.4-.6 9.4-4.6 10-10z"/></svg>
  <div class="mk-msg"><p>Your 2026 agreement sets shared game drives at <b>USD 95</b> per person per day through 31 March. Conservancy fees are <b>not</b> included — USD 116 per adult per night. For two, add USD 928 to the March quote.</p>
    <span class="mk-cite"><i></i>Rift Valley GS — rates 2026.pdf · p.2, p.5</span>
    <span class="mk-fine">From your Vault only · no outside data</span></div>
  <div class="mk-foot"><button type="button" class="mk-btn o" data-live="set" data-done="Copied">Copy</button><button type="button" class="mk-btn" data-live="set" data-done="Added to quote">Add to quote</button></div>
  <form class="mk-composer" data-live="chat" data-replies={JSON.stringify(REPLIES)} data-reply-via="Atlas · from your Vault" data-me-via="You">
    <input type="text" placeholder="Ask about your own contracts…" aria-label="Ask Atlas" autocomplete="off" />
    <button type="submit" class="mk-btn sig">Ask</button>
  </form>
</div>
